<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Not enough feeder steers and heifers were on hand to test the market.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1, couple lots 530-560 lbs 84.00- 88.50; few 600-700 lbs 81.25-84.25.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1, couple lots 530-560 lbs 73.25- 78.00.</p>
<p>Attention - There will be no weighted average report compiled this week.</p>
<p>Supply - 100</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
